    "project_purpose": "Untangled is a real-world asset (RWA) protocol that tokenizes private credit and other off-chain assets into on-chain structured products. It enables investors to deposit capital into vaults that fund real-world loans, with cash flows and risk managed through securitization pools and note tokens.",
